sec.p:
We group compounds composed solely from C, H, N, O, P and S into the “CHNOPS” batch, and compounds containing halogen elements into the “contains FClBrI” batch. For batch CHNOPS, SIRIUS 3 is run using this alphabet of elements without any further restrictions. For batch “contains FClBrI” we assume that we know upfront which of the elements, besides CHNOPS, may be contained in the compound: for example, for a compound with molecular formula \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
