				\begin{document}$$P_{\text{loss-spec}} = 1.5$$\end{document}Ploss-spec=1.5 for all fragments for which either the incoming edge (loss) is a common loss containing a special element, or for which the fragment itself contains a special element and has mass below 75 Da.

